SUMMARY:♻ Russell Semi-Annual Reconstitution - effective
DESCRIPTION:Russell Semi-Annual Reconstitution - effective\nFriday 11 Dec
 ember 2026\n\nTime\n4:00 PM ET  |  21:00 UTC\n\nNotes\nFIRST EVER Decemb
 er reconstitution of the Russell US Indexes. Effective after the close o
 n the second Friday of December\, with changes reflected from the open o
 n Monday 14 December.\n\nRussell moved from annual to semi-annual from 2
 026 - June stays on the fourth Friday\, and this is the new second date.
  Around $12 trillion is benchmarked to Russell US indexes\, though flows
  here are expected to be smaller than June's. December style-index chang
 es are limited to new additions and size-driven moves.
